  "question": {
    "text": "<p>It is observed that characteristic X-ray spectra of elements show regularity. When frequency to the power &#39;n&#39; i.e.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></msup></math>&nbsp;of X-rays emitted is plotted against atomic number <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi></math>, the following graph is obtained.</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/4e1c29e0-4b73-4a2d-86ff-3bfaf28db468-9893742.PNG\" style=\"width: 209px; height: 200px;\" /></p><p>The value of &#39;n&#39; is</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
